# dependencies
node_modules/
# Also match a node_modules symlink: `node_modules/` alone matches only real
# directories, so a linked one (common in throwaway worktrees) stays trackable
# and can be committed by a broad `git add`, breaking pnpm install on CI.
node_modules
.pnpm-store/

# build output
dist/
/apps/web/dist-spa/
out/
release/
/apps/edge-agent/resources/windows-helper/
# 注意：build/ 不在此列——它存放打包源资产（icon.ico / installer.nsh），
# 产物目录是 dist/(electron-builder) 与 out/(electron-vite)。
# 曾误忽略 build/ 导致 CI 打包报 "cannot find build/installer.nsh"。
.turbo/
*.asar
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
coverage/

# agent worktrees
# Linked worktrees created under the repo (.claude/worktrees/<name>) otherwise
# show up as untracked in every OTHER checkout sharing this .git — including the
# one an agent is mid-change in. A broad `git add -A` there would sweep another
# session's worktree into an unrelated commit.
.claude/worktrees/

# packaged binaries
*.exe
*.dmg
*.pkg
*.zip
*.blockmap

# env / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# logs
*.log
# 例外：spike 证据日志必须入库——M0 验收单硬要求 evidence/ 随产出提交，
# findings 用相对链接引用它；被 *.log 吞掉会导致 clone 后全是死链。
!tools/spikes/**/evidence/*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
*.tsbuildinfo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# editors
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.example.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# runtime (Electron userData during dev)
userData/
backups/
photos/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# 顺科原始截图（2026-07-19 终审裁决：610MB 且含 GPS/设备 EXIF，不入公开 Git；脱敏代表图另走 docs/assets/shunke/）
/shunke/
